: "对方稍微冷淡一点我就立刻打车跑了 就这样没耐心", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2076335983113765050"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-07-12T05:13:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2076173145732681752"], "id": "2076173145732681752", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4787, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "跟朋友一起住了两晚，每次睡醒我都紧紧贴着墙，她则睡在床中间。梦回高中住宿时，她不开心就来找我一起睡觉，那张不到一米宽的小床塞下了我们两个人。", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2076173145732681752"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-07-11T16:02:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2075973941185925402"], "id": "2075973941185925402", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4936, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "叫床也算一种力气活吧", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2075973941185925402"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-07-07T04:21:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2074348121723961425"], "id": "2074348121723961425", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 44821, "like_count": 529, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 78, "retweet_count": 48}, "text": "我只想找一个床下纯 床上骚的好老公安心过日子", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2074348121723961425"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-07-06T16:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2074169001400492280"], "id": "2074169001400492280", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5779, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "为什么你都不会想我吗", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2074169001400492280"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-07-06T06:43:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2074021523862737197"], "id": "2074021523862737197", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4529, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count"